#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_balance.rst:41
msgid ""
"This effect modifies the intensity of primary colors (red, green and blue). "
"It allows adjustment in the shadow, mid-tones or highlights regions for the "
"red-cyan, green-magenta or blue-yellow balance."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt upravuje intenzitu primárnych farieb (červená, zelená a modrá). "
"Umožňuje nastavenie v oblastiach tieňov, stredných tónov alebo svetiel pre "
"vyváženie červená-azúrová, zelená-purpurová alebo modrá-žltá."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/color_balance.rst:43
msgid ""
"A positive value shifts the balance towards the primary color, a negative "
"value towards the complementary color."
msgstr ""
"Kladná hodnota posunie vyváženie smerom k primárnej farbe, záporná hodnota "
"smerom k komplementárnej farbe."

